---
title: "Reading by series"
description: "Book series I've dipped into, with how far through each I am."
date: 2026-11-06
---

<p><a href="{{ '/reading/' | url }}">← Reading</a></p>

<p>{{ description }}</p>

<p><strong>{{ collections.readingSeries | length }} series</strong> logged so far. Series details are only filled in for some books, so this list is not complete yet.</p>

<ul class="author-list">
  {% for s in collections.readingSeries %}
    <li><a href="{{ ('/reading/series/' + s.key + '/') | url }}">{{ s.name }}</a> <span class="author-list__count">{{ s.books | length }}</span></li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
